    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115851" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυκ-τικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυκτήριος</span>
			, <i>cooling,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ψ.</span>”
				<i>refrigerants,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Aph.</u>
					7.37
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψ. δύναμις,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θερμαντική,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				60
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψ. φασὶν εἶναι τὸν
			οἶνον</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				59
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.652f
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				691b
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			), etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>bringing difficulty</i> (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψῦξις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					111
				</span></i>
			), <i>embarrassing,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ χρόνος ἔσται -κὸς εἰς πάντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Heph.Astr.
					2.29
				</span></i>
			.</div>
